Description: Lightweight image editor written in Qt6 and C++17
 NexImageEditor is a fast, lightweight layer-based image editor featuring
 raster, text, and shape layers, free transform, image adjustments,
 color tinting, background removal, and OpenCV-powered smart sharpen tools.
